<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-19T17:37:21.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:37:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities report a suspect in the Baniyas mass killings was arrested, while a Syrian soldier was killed by unidentified gunmen in eastern Deir ez-Zor. Damascus warns the Israeli Defense Forces over its continued buffer-zone enforcement in southern Syria, and the governor of Sweida says the capital remains open to dialogue despite security concerns. Jordan’s king reaffirmed support for Syria’s sovereignty, and the Syrian Kurdish community is reported to prefer Bashar al-Assad over Erdogan. 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5ZVnpHWENFOEhZZkpjUjVIaUJYai1ncG5jdzE0bmJ5c1JrV0xidG5oRTE5OEo2NjBYWHp3bGlOVUItbWxFb1BnYjl6ajdTWGo2YW9MZ3d2MGdzaWJ1?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTE81NGdrMFIzZk9NWWZWTE90VU5tMUVNbVp5MGJfcE5BcHpHT25UVHVRdE42YmJ3MUhpZ08tQjZVb1BkaGpiOFRzazU5S0s?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFAxUDZfZHNSMXhodE5DdkduMDNyaU5rNTc0ZmFiYUtsN2FKeUZlZDh4bU1Sa0FqLWw5alJRdW5uU21TLTB0eGFXWVBTdE91c254U1RWUHRoQkFEcHRm?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPZjhhQW9lUXB3b2hoNVhsUVdXMENCTkFKUzcwb2R6UDJjbmtBcUNTUzhFSWtvTFIwaXAwb01ubkFvY0F3a2JiZXJLX1dVT2MtcjdWS1ZVcV9qUEs2bmNMV210Y0UtbWVuVzNpYXRIWG90SXdoWkRjenRyc0FFTVlWenV6TUlHVnl1WV9vQkRXYWM0TTFDSXdUcDhYSnpqOFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;کردپرس&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQMjlNTWI5MkRxRjUtVTdfQ0lPLVdsVnhqaG9rT2k5WnpUTGRqek9TanZ1SUFBMzhoTjNZTFZlU2haMmxTNndDaGJzdllYLVk5NVkySG9zU3NCbWRPYlVwS2syNUxMOHd5bFJVMUw1TzBuVDgtNEpra3QxZFFsRGZDcjlTVkVIWjlZWkJlUD